; megacityproperties.co.uk — the zone exactly as it stood before anything moved to Cloudflare.
; Generated from docs/megacity-old-site/dns-export.txt by scripts/megacity-dns-zonefile.mjs. Do not edit by hand.
;
; Import: Cloudflare → DNS → Records → Import and Export → Import DNS records.
;         Leave "Proxy imported DNS records" OFF. Every record here is DNS only
;         (grey cloud); an orange cloud on a mail record breaks mail.
;
; The apex A record still points at the old website. That is deliberate: DNS
; moves first and the website second, so nobody notices B1 at all.
;
; SOA and NS records are deliberately absent — Cloudflare writes its own.

$ORIGIN megacityproperties.co.uk.
$TTL 3600

megacityproperties.co.uk.                         600 IN A     77.68.34.162
megacityproperties.co.uk.                        3600 IN MX    0 megacityproperties-co-uk.mail.protection.outlook.com.
megacityproperties.co.uk.                        3600 IN TXT   "v=spf1 include:secureserver.net -all"
megacityproperties.co.uk.                        3600 IN TXT   "NETORGFT5794257.onmicrosoft.com"
www.megacityproperties.co.uk.                    3600 IN CNAME megacityproperties.co.uk.
autodiscover.megacityproperties.co.uk.           3600 IN CNAME autodiscover.outlook.com.
email.megacityproperties.co.uk.                  3600 IN CNAME email.secureserver.net.
sip.megacityproperties.co.uk.                    3600 IN CNAME sipdir.online.lync.com.
lyncdiscover.megacityproperties.co.uk.           3600 IN CNAME webdir.online.lync.com.
msoid.megacityproperties.co.uk.                  3600 IN CNAME clientconfig.microsoftonline-p.net.
_domainconnect.megacityproperties.co.uk.         3600 IN CNAME _domainconnect.gd.domaincontrol.com.
_dmarc.megacityproperties.co.uk.                 3600 IN TXT   "v=DMARC1;p=none;adkim=r;aspf=r;pct=100;rf=afrf"
s1._domainkey.megacityproperties.co.uk.          1800 IN CNAME s1.domainkey.u2309198.wl199.sendgrid.net.
s2._domainkey.megacityproperties.co.uk.          1800 IN CNAME s2.domainkey.u2309198.wl199.sendgrid.net.
_amazonses.megacityproperties.co.uk.             3600 IN TXT   "juNkJZcd/CGB2doV4qI/mEtLARs10FM7N5qWd/9Q1Og="
_sip._tls.megacityproperties.co.uk.              3600 IN SRV   100 1 443 sipdir.online.lync.com.
_sipfederationtls._tcp.megacityproperties.co.uk. 3600 IN SRV   100 1 5061 sipfed.online.lync.com.
